<main>
<div class="toolbar no-print">
<select id="storeFilter" aria-label="Filter store"><option value="all">All stores</option></select>
<select id="statusFilter" aria-label="Filter performance"><option value="all">All performance</option><option value="positive">Positive variance</option><option value="negative">Negative variance</option><option value="missing">Incomplete sales data</option></select>
<input id="search" placeholder="Search account or establishment..." aria-label="Search accounts">
<button class="primary" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>
<button onclick="addAccount()">+ Add account</button>
<button onclick="exportCSV()">Export CSV</button>
<button onclick="resetFilters()">Reset filters</button>
</div>
<section class="kpis" id="kpis"></section>
<div class="section-title"><div><h2>Performance overview</h2><p>Figures are calculated from values recorded in the uploaded workbook.</p></div></div>
<section class="charts">
<div class="panel"><h3>Current year vs. last year sales by store</h3><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="salesChart"></canvas></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="dot" style="background:#c8102e"></i>Current year</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#aab3c2"></i>Last year</span></div></div>
<div class="panel"><h3>Sales variance distribution</h3><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="varianceChart"></canvas></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="dot" style="background:#168653"></i>Positive</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#c8102e"></i>Negative</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#aab3c2"></i>Not recorded</span></div></div>
</section>
<div class="section-title"><div><h2>Store summary</h2><p>Account counts and recorded sales by store.</p></div></div>
<section class="store-summary" id="storeSummary"></section>
<div class="section-title"><div><h2>Historical account register</h2><p>Search and filter establishment-level opportunity and sales records.</p></div><span class="tag" id="recordCount">0 records</span></div>
<section class="panel table-panel">
<div class="table-top"><div><h3>Editable account-level details</h3><div style="font-size:11px;color:#687386;margin-top:3px">Click any field to edit. Variance and dashboard totals update automatically.</div></div><span class="tag" id="saveStatus">Changes save in this browser</span></div>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Store</th><th>Account / Establishment</th><th>Population</th><th>Forecasted sales (₱)</th><th>Current year sales (₱)</th><th>Last year sales (₱)</th><th>Variance (₱)</th></tr></thead><tbody id="dataRows"></tbody></table></div>
</section>
<div class="note"><strong>Reporting note:</strong> This report preserves the source workbook's recorded values. Blank cells are treated as “not recorded,” not as zero. When both current-year and last-year sales are entered, variance is automatically calculated as current year minus last year. Confirm the reporting year labels and update incomplete entries before using this report as a final performance submission.</div>
</main>
<footer>JCBOS • Historical Sales & Market Opportunity • Prepared from the supplied HISTORICAL DATA workbook</footer>
